&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a Senior Electrical Engineer, you will help lead a talented cross functional team through full product lifecycles and engagement models ranging from in-house design to ODM and Tier1 projects with domestic and international partners. Our designs include sensors, vehicle controls, bleeding edge AI powered compute and anything our teams need in our journey toward a driverless world.&lt;/p&gt;
